Description: 4k intro by Suricrasia Online, released in 2019
 scaleMARK is a 4k intro for Linux by blackle (code, graphics and music),
 ranked 1st in the combined intro competition at @party 2019.
 .
 It runs fullscreen at 1920x1080 with 4 samples per pixel; the --window
 option runs the lighter 640x360 windowed variant for slower GPUs.
 .
 This package is built from the sources, with the system libraries
 (SDL2, libspectre, Opus) instead of the size-optimised packed binary.
